  "join.training.title": {
    "en": "Training & Mentoring",
    "zh": "培养方式"
  },
  "join.training.lead": {
    "en": "From first research steps to independent work, connect each stage of your development through systematic training, individual guidance and real projects.",
    "zh": "从科研入门到独立研究，用系统训练、个性化指导和真实项目连接每一步成长。"
  },
  "join.training.full": {
    "en": "<p>Our approach combines sustained mentoring, systematic training and hands-on work. We support students from their first research steps to independent work, combining structured training with individual guidance to develop research, academic communication and engineering skills.</p>\n<ul><li>Regular academic exchange: building research perspective and critical thinking<ul>\n<li>Weekly group meetings: we study recent papers from leading conferences and journals. The supervisor guides close reading of core contributions, experimental design, writing and research methods, encouraging discussion and critical thinking.</li>\n<li>Focused discussions and progress reports: regular research updates, literature reviews and project proposals help students organize their thinking and develop presentation, analytical and critical-questioning skills.</li>\n</ul></li><li>Individual supervision: addressing research challenges<ul>\n<li>At least one dedicated discussion each week: individual guidance covers research direction, obstacles, experiments and writing, from topic selection and study design to detailed refinements.</li>\n<li>Support throughout the process: literature review, research planning, experimental improvement, data processing, analysis, manuscript revision, submission and responses to reviewers.</li>\n</ul></li><li>Academic support: broadening opportunities for exchange<ul>\n<li>Support for domestic and international conferences: students are encouraged to attend respected conferences, with guidance on participation and academic exchange, to meet researchers and present their work.</li>\n<li>Publication practice and academic standards: training covers submission procedures, choosing journals and conferences, and responding to reviews.</li>\n</ul></li><li>Connecting research and industry: practical experience<ul>\n<li>Internship recommendations: connections with companies and research institutes help us recommend suitable opportunities, connecting research with engineering practice and industry projects.</li>\n<li>Collaborative applied projects: students are encouraged to join externally funded and real-world projects that develop practical problem-solving skills and connect research with industry needs.</li>\n</ul></li><li>Training across the research process<ul>\n<li>Research design: literature search and review, defining questions, identifying contributions, designing experiments, and selecting controls and comparisons.</li>\n<li>Experimental methods: systematic data collection, processing, analysis and visualization; professional tools, replication and verification; and rigorous, reproducible research habits.</li>\n<li>Academic writing: guidance on structure, abstracts, argumentation, figures and language, with focused practice in English writing, academic standards and responses to reviewers.</li>\n</ul></li></ul>\n<p>Our focus is developing ability, beyond completing projects or publishing papers. We want students to independently identify problems, design studies, solve problems and communicate results, building a foundation for further study, academic research or other careers.</p>",
    "zh": "\n<p>我们以全程陪伴、系统训练、实战落地为核心，为学生搭建从科研入门到独立开展高水平研究的完整成长路径，通过标准化训练与个性化指导相结合，助力每位学生毕业时具备独立科研、学术表达与工程实践的综合能力。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>常态化学术交流：夯实科研视野与思维\n          <ul>\n<li>每周固定组会：聚焦领域内顶会、顶刊最新论文，由导师带领精读核心创新点、实验设计、写作逻辑与研究范式，引导学生深度讨论、批判性思考，培养前沿学术视野。</li>\n<li>专题研讨与成果汇报：定期开展研究进展汇报、文献综述分享、课题思路答辩，倒逼学生主动梳理研究脉络，锻炼逻辑表达、问题分析与学术质疑能力。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>导师一对一指导：精准解决研究难题\n          <ul>\n<li>每周至少 1 次专属沟通：导师针对每位学生的课题方向、研究瓶颈、实验进展、论文撰写进行个性化深度指导，从选题、方案设计到细节调整全程把关。</li>\n<li>全程跟踪式辅导：覆盖从文献调研、研究框架搭建、实验方案优化，到数据处理、结果分析、论文修改与投稿返修的全流程，及时纠偏、高效推进研究。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>高水平学术支持：拓宽学术交流平台\n          <ul>\n<li>全力支持国内外学术会议：鼓励并支持学生参加领域权威学术会议，提供参会指导、学术交流建议，助力学生与国内外顶尖学者面对面沟通、展示研究成果、积累学术资源。</li>\n<li>学术规范与投稿训练：系统讲解论文投稿流程、期刊 / 会议选择、返修回复技巧，帮助学生熟悉学术出版规则，提升投稿命中率。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>产学研结合：提供多元实践机会\n          <ul>\n<li>优质企业实习推荐：对接行业内优质企业与科研院所，为学生推荐匹配度高的实习岗位，将科研理论与工程实践结合，积累工业界项目经验，提升就业与深造竞争力。</li>\n<li>产学研课题联动：鼓励参与横向课题与实际应用项目，培养解决真实场景问题的能力，实现学术研究与产业需求双向赋能。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>全链条科研训练：打造完整科研能力\n          <ul>\n<li>研究设计训练：教授文献检索与综述、研究问题提炼、创新点挖掘、实验方案设计、变量控制与对照设置，建立严谨研究逻辑。</li>\n<li>实验方法指导：规范数据采集、处理、分析与可视化流程，教授专业工具使用、实验复现与结果验证方法，培养严谨、可复现的科研习惯。</li>\n<li>论文写作专项提升：从结构搭建、摘要撰写、逻辑表达、图表设计到语言润色全程指导，针对性训练英文写作、学术规范与审稿意见回复，让学生掌握高水平学术论文的完整写作能力。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n        我们始终坚持以能力培养为核心，不只是完成课题、发表论文，更让学生真正掌握独立发现问题、设计研究、解决问题、输出成果的完整科研素养，为后续深造、学术研究或职业发展打下坚实基础。\n      </p>\n"
  },
